    "methods_description": "Electrocorticographic (ECoG) recordings were obtained from 9 participants using grid, depth, and strip electrodes during passive listening to a 30-minute naturalistic story containing over 5,000 words. Raw data are provided alongside minimally preprocessed high-gamma spectral band data. Aligned word-level transcripts and linguistic features ranging from low-level acoustic properties to large language model embeddings are included.",
